    /// Record a deposit
    ///
    /// Records that this address has deposited, so its progress can be followed and it can appear in history while it is still on its way. Nothing is registered with Lighter here: the deposit call on Ethereum already names its recipient, and Lighter keeps only what arrived, not what was intended.
